    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.00",
    "summary": "A Transport can carry other units around the battlefield. This chapter explains Transport Capacity, Embarking and Disembarking. Leaving the Transport uses the Disembark Move or Emergency Disembark Move. The Rapid Disembark panel explains when Ingress restrictions carry over to passengers.",
